Author: Nithin <nithinkamat@gmail.com>
Date:   Tue Oct 27 13:05:12 2026 -0700

    CPOS-E-011,E-012,E-013,E-027,E-028: Enforce snapshot monotonicity, trajectory raw_inputs immutability, and full provenance columns
    
    Ledger IDs: E-011, E-012, E-013, E-027, E-028
    - Enforce same-day confidence monotonicity on sp500_scores snapshot writes in DataStore.record_quality_result (E-011).
    - Pass unmutated raw_dict to record_trajectory_result in ScannerPipeline._run_trajectory_stage so trajectory_history.raw_inputs_json is never polluted with derived peer keys (E-012).
    - Add additive registry_id and registry_hash columns to sp500_scores and registry_id to sp500_scores_history, stamp them on writes, and enforce registry_hash == CANONICAL_REGISTRY_HASH in the canonical write-guard (E-013, E-027, E-028).
    - Add regression tests in compounderos_app/test_lens_boundary_invariant.py.

